### Arquivo para a extensão "REST Client" do VS Code ou o HTTP Client do IntelliJ

@base = http://localhost:8080

### Busca principal (cache + fallback)
GET {{base}}/ceps/69005-040

### Busca por endereço
GET {{base}}/ceps?uf=AM&cidade=Manaus&logradouro=Djalma

### Somente ViaCEP (REST Client)
GET {{base}}/ceps/69005040/viacep

### Somente BrasilAPI (REST Client)
GET {{base}}/ceps/69005040/brasilapi

### ViaCEP via java.net.http.HttpClient (síncrono)
GET {{base}}/ceps/69005040/jdk

### ViaCEP via java.net.http.HttpClient (assíncrono)
GET {{base}}/ceps/69005040/jdk-async

### CEP inválido -> 400
GET {{base}}/ceps/123

### CEP inexistente -> 404
GET {{base}}/ceps/99999999
